<title>FRANCE: Carrefour in Colombian joint venture.</title>
<headline>Carrefour in Colombian joint venture.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carrefour said it had signed a partnership deal with Santo Domingo of Colombia and Sigla of Spain to set up a joint venture company in Colombia.</p>
<p>The company will be 55 percent owned by Carrefour, 35 percent by Santo Domingo and 10 percent by Sigla.</p>
<p>Carrefour gave no further details.</p>
</text>
